# Acceptance replay: offline solo play-through of Evergreen (seed 1).
# Title -> main menu (boot_menu), Play now -> world list, Evergreen -> the Well,
# N = New Soul, type the name, RETURN = OK (hero_ready) -> incarnate on map 0 (map_enter).
expect boot_menu 900
key RETURN
wait 30
key RETURN
wait 30
key n
wait 5
text Tester
key RETURN
expect hero_ready 300
expect map_enter 600
# Walk east, then south until a random encounter pulls the hero into fight scene 2.
hold RIGHT 60
expect hero_move 300
keydown DOWN
expect battle_start 1200
keyup DOWN
# Fight: A attacks the first live monster; the attack is queued until the hero's turn.
